    <item>
      <title>Back from the past: Audio denoising demo</title>
      <link>https://benoitfauve.github.io/posts/2026-10-17-back-from-the-past-spectral-subtraction/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://benoitfauve.github.io/posts/2026-10-17-back-from-the-past-spectral-subtraction/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I recently dusted off one of my first projects in speech processing: a demo with a simple graphical interface showing real-time denoising of an audio signal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This project was part of an Erasmus break in the &amp;ldquo;Speech and Image Group&amp;rdquo; at the University of Wales Swansea, when I was finishing my degree at ENSPM (now Centrale Marseille).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure class=&#34;waveplayers-figure&#34; style=&#34;max-width: 440px&#34;&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;waveplayers&#34; style=&#34;--wp-cols: 1&#34;&gt;

&lt;script src=&#34;https://benoitfauve.github.io/js/vendor/wavesurfer-8.0.3.min.js&#34; defer&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script src=&#34;https://benoitfauve.github.io/js/waveplayer.js&#34; defer&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;waveplayer waveplayer--compact waveplayer--mint&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button class=&#34;wp-play&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; aria-label=&#34;Play&#34;&gt;
    &lt;svg class=&#34;wp-icon-play&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M8 5.5v13l11-6.5z&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
    &lt;svg class=&#34;wp-icon-pause&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 5h3.5v14H7zM13.5 5H17v14h-3.5z&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;wp-body&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;wp-wave&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;audio controls preload=&#34;metadata&#34; src=&#34;https://benoitfauve.github.io/audio/throwitaway.noisy.wav&#34;&gt;&lt;/audio&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;span class=&#34;wp-time&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;div class=&#34;waveplayer waveplayer--compact waveplayer--mint&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button class=&#34;wp-play&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; aria-label=&#34;Play&#34;&gt;
    &lt;svg class=&#34;wp-icon-play&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M8 5.5v13l11-6.5z&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
    &lt;svg class=&#34;wp-icon-pause&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 5h3.5v14H7zM13.5 5H17v14h-3.5z&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;wp-body&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;wp-wave&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;audio controls preload=&#34;metadata&#34; src=&#34;https://benoitfauve.github.io/audio/throwitaway.a2-b0.05.wav&#34;&gt;&lt;/audio&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;span class=&#34;wp-time&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;figcaption&gt;Top: noisy input, the 2001 car recording. Bottom: denoised by spectral subtraction (α = 2, β = 0.05).&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;h2 id=&#34;some-fond-memories-ticking-the-boxes-and-beyond&#34;&gt;Some fond memories, ticking the boxes and beyond&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I have some good memories of this project.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
